# File-effect audit regression checklist

- [ ] Exact candidate creation with a complete matching event can PASS.
- [ ] Create-then-delete helper activity fails even when inventories are equal.
- [ ] Outside-workspace and traversal paths fail after structural normalization.
- [ ] Complete events cannot omit residual changes.
- [ ] Partial/unknown event observability yields partial/inconclusive, never PASS.
- [ ] Symlinks and type changes fail closed without following targets.
- [ ] Unknown event fields, malformed hashes and duplicate IDs are rejected.
- [ ] Mathematical text containing slashes is never scanned as a path.
